<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">VOIDSCAR ARENA · MYTHIC+ · RETRIBUTION PALADIN</div>
    <h1><span class="cls">惩戒骑</span><span class="dot">·</span>虚空之痕竞技场 应对手册</h1>
    <p class="lede">虚空之痕竞技场的首领伤害几乎全是<b>暗影和自然魔法</b>，保护祝福挡不住。<b>圣盾术</b>留给塔兹拉尔的空灵冲刺和煞戎努斯的星辰坠击，开完立刻接<b>牺牲祝福</b>，圣盾持续的 8 秒内转过来的伤害全是 0；<b>圣佑术</b>约一分钟一次，轮流接钉锤风暴、险恶光环、冲刺、剧毒光环、恐惧咆哮和星辰坠击。小怪段的牺牲祝福转好就给被虚空光束点名的队友。</p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">参考 <b>+23 限时惩戒（国 / 欧 / 美）</b></span>
      <span class="chip">英雄天赋 <b>烈日先驱</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="nav" aria-label="阶段导航">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nav-scroll">
      <a href="#prep" class="on">速记</a>
      <a href="#timeline">时间轴</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#s1">开场</a>
      <a href="#s2">竞技场</a>
      <a href="#s3"><span class="n">①</span>塔兹拉尔</a>
      <a href="#s4">掠心者</a>
      <a href="#s5"><span class="n">②</span>阿特洛苏斯</a>
      <a href="#s6">残虐者</a>
      <a href="#s7"><span class="n">③</span>煞戎努斯</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#talent">天赋</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

<section id="prep">
  <h2><span class="k">00</span>开打前速记</h2>
  <p class="sub">四张手牌管住全本，外加一条硬限制和五个必断读条。</p>

  <div class="cores">
    <article class="core main">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:642}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">圣盾术</div><div class="cd">3.5 分钟 · 持续 8 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>全免伤害、击退和强制移动。必留给塔兹拉尔的空灵冲刺和煞戎努斯的星辰坠击；顺手交前先确认距下个必留点不少于 3.5 分钟。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:6940}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">牺牲祝福</div><div class="cd">1 分钟 · 持续 12 秒 · 转走 30%</div></div></div>
      <p>圣盾开着的 8 秒内转过来的伤害全是 0，所以圣盾后马上接；平时转好就给被虚空光束点名的队友。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:403876}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">圣佑术</div><div class="cd">约 1 分钟 · 持续 8 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>受到伤害 −30%，并附带吸收 30% 最大生命值的复仇之盾。转好就交给下一个大伤害点，三个首领都按轮次安排。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:633}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">圣疗术</div><div class="cd">7 分钟 · 回满 100% 最大生命值</div></div></div>
      <p>塔兹拉尔那一轮没有圣佑、圣盾盖住的冲刺，血线掉到一半以下就给自己按。治疗之手按缺血量再缩短冷却。</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="limit">
    <div class="h">自律与保护祝福硬限制</div>
    <b>保护祝福只挡物理</b>：险恶光环、空灵冲刺、剧毒光环、恐惧咆哮、星辰坠击都是魔法伤害，交保护照样掉血；这本里可备选拿它清野蛮飞跃流血（钉锤风暴、巨响咆哮虽为物理，但通常交圣佑或靠治疗）。<b>圣盾、保护、圣疗共用 30 秒自律</b>：开过圣盾或保护后 30 秒内不能给自己保护或圣疗；反过来先圣疗或保护、再开圣盾可以（圣光决断）。
  </div>

  <div class="kicks-box">
    <div class="kicks-head">
      <img class="ic" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="责难">
      <h3>全本必断读条</h3>
      <span>点击跳到对应战斗</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kicks">
      <a class="kick" href="#k-roar">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">01</span><span>被统御的斗士 · 开场 / 残虐者</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">挫志怒吼</div>
        <div class="why">4 秒读条、100 码，开场第一个要断；若连带前一波斗士进煞戎努斯，继续照断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-sand">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">02</span><span>暴怒的三叶虫 · 竞技场</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">狂暴之沙</div>
        <div class="why">60 码全团自然伤害并减速 40%，三叶虫上场就盯着断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-lava">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">03</span><span>被奴役的萨满 · 塔兹拉尔后 / 后段</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">熔岩箭</div>
        <div class="why">读条快、反复读，萨满在的每一堆都优先给它。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-volley">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">04</span><span>虚触法师 · 阿特洛苏斯后</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">暗影箭雨</div>
        <div class="why">60 码全团暗影，一发都别让它读完。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-mend">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">05</span><span>虚空看顾者 · 阿特洛苏斯后</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">愈体虚空</div>
        <div class="why">可断引导技，一引导就立刻断，不然每 2 秒都在回 3% 血。</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="timeline">
  <h2><span class="k">01</span>一场里圣盾和保人牌交在哪</h2>
  <p class="sub">一场 +23 限时实录（展示真实冷却节奏，非每波强制照搬；具体取舍见下方路线）。</p>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-scroll">
{{TIMELINE}}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i class="pri"></i>圣盾术 + 牺牲</span>
      <span><i class="e"></i>牺牲祝福 · 保队友</span>
      <span><i class="v"></i>圣佑术</span>
      <span><i class="muted"></i>圣疗自救</span>
      <span><i class="boss"></i>首领战</span>
      <span><i class="trash"></i>小怪段</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="route">
  <h2><span class="k">02</span>按路线逐段</h2>
  <p class="sub">看到什么 → 按什么 → 为什么。带「必做」标签的高亮行是每把必做的关键动作。伤害数字是 +23 实测（含被吸收的部分），层数越高越大。</p>

  <div class="route">

    <!-- 开场 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s1">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>开场 → 竞技场</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 被统御的斗士 / 鲁莽监督者 / 不屈的埃吉拉 / 狂野的刃牙虎人 / 迷失的蛇人</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>开场不需要圣盾：圣佑开在鲁莽监督者的钉锤风暴上，凶猛飞跃点到队友可备选给牺牲祝福。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row" id="k-roar">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1298899}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">挫志怒吼</div><div class="s">被统御的斗士 · 4 秒读条 · 100 码</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="">责难</span></div>
            <div class="why">三个斗士轮流读，责难一好就交。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1228126}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">钉锤风暴</div><div class="s">鲁莽监督者冲向一人 · 6 秒每秒一跳 · 8 码物理</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">冲到你身边就开，每跳从约 47 万降到约 28 万。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1299133}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">凶猛飞跃</div><div class="s">不屈的埃吉拉 2 秒读条扑一人 · 物理一下 + 4 秒流血</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:6940}}" alt="">牺牲祝福（备选）</span><span class="tgt">给被扑中的队友</span></div>
            <div class="why">扑中一下约 59 万，后面 4 秒每秒再掉约 38 万；牺牲可给被扑中的队友转走三成，扑到自己也可备选圣佑。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1298933}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">野蛮猛击</div><div class="s">埃吉拉锁定一人 8 秒后砸地 · 6 码物理 + 6 秒跳伤</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">离开队友分散站</span></div>
            <div class="why">被锁定就带出人群，别溅射队友；圣佑术优先留给钉锤风暴。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1298901}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">残暴猛击</div><div class="s">鲁莽监督者开盾 · 每 1.5 秒递增全团物理（持续 30 秒）</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">优先转火打掉护盾</span></div>
            <div class="why">每次猛击叠高 8% 伤害，越早破盾团队压力越小。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1298917}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">勇士之矛</div><div class="s">长矛链住全队 · 每秒物理一跳并往里拉</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">转火打掉长矛</span></div>
            <div class="why">长矛不碎就一直跳，减伤不用交在这里。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">建议：圣佑交钉锤风暴 · 凶猛飞跃可备选给牺牲 · 圣盾不交</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s2">下一段：竞技场 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 竞技场 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s2">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>竞技场 → 塔兹拉尔</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 狂野的刃牙虎人 / 长牙海象人 / 充满保护欲的乌龟 / 几丁高斯 / 暴怒的三叶虫</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>几丁高斯的险恶光环约 20 秒一次、连放三次，圣佑交其中一次。最后一次光环离塔兹拉尔计划交圣盾那轮冲刺不少于 3.5 分钟时，才可备选交圣盾 + 牺牲；算不准就留着。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1267894}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">野蛮飞跃</div><div class="s">刃牙虎人扑人 · 物理一下 + 5 秒流血</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span><span class="or">备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1022}}" alt="">保护祝福</span></div>
            <div class="why">虎人多的那几堆会连着扑，圣佑转好就开，每跳少三成；圣佑冷却中又被扑，可备选保护祝福给自己，当场清掉流血（之后 30 秒自律内保护/圣疗交不到自己身上，点了圣光决断仍可开圣盾）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1250695}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>险恶光环</div><div class="s">几丁高斯瞬发 · 8 秒每 2 秒一跳 · 100 码自然</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span><span class="or">备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span></div>
            <div class="why">光环一出就开圣佑，8 秒正好盖住一整次。自然伤害，保护祝福挡不住。距塔兹拉尔第四轮冲刺 ≥ 3.5 分钟时，第三次光环可开圣盾再接牺牲给队友。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1250021}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">甲壳守护</div><div class="s">充满保护欲的乌龟 · 周围小怪减伤 75%（持续 20 秒）</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">配合拉开或转火</span></div>
            <div class="why">罩子里的怪几乎打不动，等坦克带出范围或集火清掉乌龟再交爆发。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-sand">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1249621}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">狂暴之沙</div><div class="s">暴怒的三叶虫读条 · 60 码自然 · 减速 40%</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="">责难</span></div>
            <div class="why">这一段的第一打断目标。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">建议：圣佑交一次险恶光环 · 圣盾 0–1 次（距塔兹拉尔第四轮冲刺 ≥ 3.5 分钟才交）</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s3">下一段：塔兹拉尔 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 1 塔兹拉尔 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s3">
      <div class="node">1</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>塔兹拉尔</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 1</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>空灵冲刺每 <b>35 秒</b>一轮：虚灵之影读条 7 秒后冲向每一名玩家，一下 + 15 秒暗影跳伤。圣佑约 1 分钟（63 秒）转好一次，按 35 秒一轮刚好<b>隔一轮交一次</b>；中间那轮（第二或第四轮）交圣盾 + 牺牲；剩下没盖住的那轮血低就圣疗自救。</div>
        <div class="subhead">一轮空灵冲刺（以虚灵之影开始读条为 0 秒）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">0 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1222103}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">空灵冲刺（开始读条）</div><div class="s">7 秒读条 → 约 +7 秒五道影子依次冲出</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">按轮次决定交哪张</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条期间不掉血，别提前把圣佑按空。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">约 +5 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1222103}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">冲出前 1–2 秒 · 圣佑轮</div><div class="s">第一、三、五轮</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">一下和前几秒跳伤一起少三成，复仇之盾再吸一截。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">+4–6 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:642}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>读条后半段 · 圣盾轮</div><div class="s">第二或第四轮（圣佑冷却中）</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:6940}}" alt="">牺牲祝福</span><span class="tgt">给没有魔法减伤的近战</span></div>
            <div class="why">冲出前开好圣盾，这一轮一下和 15 秒跳伤都不上身（开晚被冲中后再开也能当场清掉跳伤）；紧接着牺牲给队友（如武器战，贼有斗篷不用给），<b>圣盾持续的 8 秒内转过来的三成全是 0</b>，盾结束后最后 4–5 秒仍会掉血，注意血线。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">冲出后</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:633}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">没被盖住的那一轮</div><div class="s">一下约 78 万 + 每秒约 19 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:633}}" alt="">圣疗术</span></div>
            <div class="why">血线掉到一半以下给自己圣疗。开过圣盾的 30 秒内不行（自律），所以圣疗要么交在圣盾之前那一轮，要么等 30 秒后。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">约 +25 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300259}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">黑暗绽放（开始读条）</div><div class="s">4 秒读条 · 全团暗影 · 引爆地上的虚空裂隙</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">躲开裂隙</span></div>
            <div class="why">一下约 97 万，减伤都排在冲刺上，这一下靠治疗提前抬满；同时躲开幽影破裂的落点和裂隙。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">空灵冲刺冲中你那一下吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">78.2 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>圣佑 + 复仇之盾</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:70%">54.7 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>圣盾术</span><div class="bar"><span class="zero">0 · 免疫</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">建议：圣盾 + 牺牲 1 次</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑隔轮交冲刺 · 圣疗补没盖住的那轮</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s4">下一段：掠心者 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 掠心者 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s4">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>塔兹拉尔 → 阿特洛苏斯</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 被奴役的萨满 / 警惕的掠心者 / 千噬兽尖啸者 / 野蛮裂爪兽 / 熔岩图腾</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>圣盾刚在塔兹拉尔用掉，这一段靠牺牲和圣佑。牺牲 1 分钟冷却，虚空光束点名队友时转好就给（冷却中连续出光束靠队友自保与治疗）。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row" id="k-lava">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1228176}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">熔岩箭 / 疯狂尖啸</div><div class="s">被奴役的萨满读条 · 千噬兽尖啸者 6 秒群体恐惧</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="">责难</span></div>
            <div class="why">责难优先熔岩箭；分工到尖啸者就断疯狂尖啸。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300138}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>虚空光束点名队友</div><div class="s">警惕的掠心者 2 秒读条 · 4 秒每 0.5 秒一跳 · 落点 8 码</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:6940}}" alt="">牺牲祝福</span><span class="tgt">给被点的队友</span></div>
            <div class="why">光束每跳约 25 万、跳满必死，读条一结束就给被点的人，转走三成；他要离开人群 8 码。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300138}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">虚空光束点到你</div><div class="s">同上 · 暗影</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">开圣佑再走出人群，每跳从约 25 万降到约 18 万。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1239855}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">天空打击</div><div class="s">掠心者读条冲锋 · 10 码内平摊 · 击飞</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">靠近一起分摊</span></div>
            <div class="why">伤害由 10 码内的人平分，<b>站进来参与分摊的人越多</b>，每人分到的越少（命中会击飞）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246825}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">灼热岩浆</div><div class="s">熔岩图腾 · 每 0.3 秒随机一人火焰</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">先打图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">图腾不倒就一直点人，转火比交减伤划算。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:6940}}" alt="">建议：牺牲给虚空光束目标 · 责难优先熔岩箭</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s5">下一段：阿特洛苏斯 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 2 阿特洛苏斯 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s5">
      <div class="node">2</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>阿特洛苏斯</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 2</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>巨响咆哮约 <b>50 秒</b>一次，每次召出一只剧毒蠕行者，蠕行者活着时每 0.5 秒一跳全团自然。圣佑约 1 分钟（63 秒）转好，交<b>第一、三只</b>蠕行者；第二、四只圣佑冷却，圣盾转好可备选，没好就集火蠕行者靠治疗。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1262497}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">巨响咆哮</div><div class="s">3 秒读条 · 全团物理无视护甲 · 召出剧毒蠕行者</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">先别交圣佑</span></div>
            <div class="why">咆哮这一下靠治疗抬；圣佑要等蠕行者冒出来再开，才盖得住后面连续的光环。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1222692}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>剧毒光环 · 第一、三只</div><div class="s">剧毒蠕行者 · 每 0.5 秒一跳 · 100 码自然</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">咆哮落地约 4 秒后第一跳，<b>光环开始跳时开好</b>（略晚几跳也能盖住中后段）；不开每秒要掉约 21 万，圣佑每跳少三成，复仇之盾再吸掉几跳。同时转火蠕行者，光环跟它一起没。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1222692}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">剧毒光环 · 第二、四只</div><div class="s">圣佑冷却中</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">集火蠕行者</span><span class="or">备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span></div>
            <div class="why">距煞戎努斯那轮星辰坠击 ≥ 3.5 分钟即可开圣盾（后面小怪段超 7 分钟，这里放心交），光环减益当场清掉、期间全免；没好就集火蠕行者，血低喝药。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1263971}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒液喷溅 / 麻痹药膏</div><div class="s">每秒全团自然 + 落点留毒池 · 踩池急速 −30%</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:213644}}" alt="">清毒术</span></div>
            <div class="why">躲开落点毒团和毒池，全团跳伤靠治疗；自己或队友踩到麻痹药膏顺手解。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1222721}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒性吐息</div><div class="s">读条 · 正前方自然</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">别站首领正面</span></div>
            <div class="why">正面一口很痛，绕到侧后打。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">剧毒光环每一跳吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">10.5 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>圣佑术</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:70%">7.4 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">建议：圣佑交第一、三只蠕行者 · 圣盾 0–1 次（备选）</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s6">下一段：残虐者 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 残虐者 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s6">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>阿特洛苏斯 → 煞戎努斯</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 食腐虹虚魔 / 贪噬残虐者 / 虚触法师 / 虚空看顾者 / 警惕的掠心者 / 被奴役的萨满</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span>恐惧咆哮、熔岩图腾和虚空光束会叠在一起。圣佑转好就交恐惧咆哮；<b>圣盾只有距煞戎努斯放圣盾那轮星辰坠击 ≥ 3.5 分钟才交</b>，否则全程圣佑 + 牺牲顶。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1252406}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>恐惧咆哮</div><div class="s">贪噬残虐者 4.5 秒读条 · 击退 + 12 秒暗影跳伤</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span><span class="or">备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条快结束时开圣佑，每跳少三成（开晚也能减免剩余跳伤）；圣盾满足 ≥ 3.5 分钟间隔可备选在读条末开，咆哮和跳伤全免。残虐者读<b>吞噬</b>回半血时配合控停或集火。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-volley">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1299938}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">暗影箭雨</div><div class="s">虚触法师读条 · 60 码全团暗影</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="">责难</span></div>
            <div class="why">虚触法师在的那几堆责难先给它。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-mend">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1310324}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">愈体虚空</div><div class="s">虚空看顾者引导 · 20 秒每 2 秒回 3% 血</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:96231}}" alt="">责难</span></div>
            <div class="why">可断引导技，<b>一引导就立刻断</b>，不然每 2 秒都在抬血。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1299913}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">虚无喷发</div><div class="s">虚触法师读条 · 落点 10 码一下 + 5 秒跳伤</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">走出落点</span></div>
            <div class="why">一下约 84 万，站着不动跳伤（每跳约 22 万）也全吃。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300138}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">虚空光束 / 熔岩箭</div><div class="s">掠心者和萨满（同前段）</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:6940}}" alt="">牺牲祝福</span><span class="tgt">给被点的队友</span></div>
            <div class="why">和塔兹拉尔后面那堆一样：光束点谁牺牲给谁，熔岩箭责难。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">建议：圣佑交恐惧咆哮 · 圣盾 0–1 次（距煞戎努斯那轮星辰坠击 ≥ 3.5 分钟才交）</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s7">下一段：煞戎努斯 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 3 煞戎努斯 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s7">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>煞戎努斯</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>约 <b>53 秒</b>一轮：先出不稳定的奇点，再读星辰坠击。圣佑约 1 分钟（63 秒）转好，交<b>第一、三次</b>星辰坠击；中间圣盾转好的那次（第二或第四次）交圣盾 + 牺牲。若连带前一波被统御的斗士进首领战，挫志怒吼照断。</div>
        <div class="subhead">一轮（以不稳定的奇点开始读条为 0 秒）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">0 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1248112}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">不稳定的奇点（开始读条）</div><div class="s">6 秒读条 → 奇点每秒打全队并往中心拉</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">往外走，别被拉进去</span></div>
            <div class="why">被拉进奇点中心直接死，减伤救不了；跳伤不高，不用单独交牌。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+12 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300372}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">星辰坠击（开始读条）· 圣佑轮</div><div class="s">5 秒读条 → 落点 8 码一下 + 击退 + 20 秒跳伤</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条最后一秒开，落地那一下和跳伤开头一起少三成。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">+14–15 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:642}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>星辰坠击读条后半段 · 圣盾轮</div><div class="s">第二或第四次（圣佑冷却中）</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:6940}}" alt="">牺牲祝福</span><span class="tgt">给另一名输出</span></div>
            <div class="why">落地前 2–3 秒开圣盾：一下和 20 秒跳伤都不上身，<b>击退和奇点的拉扯也免疫</b>，身上的奇点减益当场清掉（圣光决断每清一个回 10% 血）。随后接牺牲，<b>圣盾持续的 8 秒内转过来的也是 0</b>，盾结束后最后 4–5 秒仍会掉血，注意走位与血线。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">约 +23 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1310025}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">引力宝珠</div><div class="s">追踪你，每秒叠凝缩物质（暗影 + 减速）</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">把宝珠带进奇点 6 码</span></div>
            <div class="why">宝珠进奇点 6 码就被摧毁；拖着不处理，减速越叠越深更容易被奇点拉进去。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">约 +30–38 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1227247}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">虚空奔涌 / 暗影浪潮</div><div class="s">地面能量波 · 命中暗影伤害 + 击退</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">躲开波纹防击退</span></div>
            <div class="why">落在圣盾已结束、奇点仍在拉人的阶段，别被暗影波弹进奇点。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">星辰坠击砸中你那一下吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">63.2 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>圣佑 + 复仇之盾</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:70%">44.1 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>圣盾术</span><div class="bar"><span class="zero">0 · 免疫</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">建议：圣盾 + 牺牲 1 次</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑交第一、三次星辰坠击</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#talent">查看天赋 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="talent">
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">取自 +23 限时录像的惩戒天赋，英雄天赋烈日先驱。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-label">这四个防御天赋不要动</p>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:114154}}" alt=""><div><b>不败之魂</b><span>圣盾、圣佑、圣疗冷却 −30%：圣佑 63 秒才能稳接三首领轮次，圣盾 3.5 分钟也多出中段备选机会。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:384820}}" alt=""><div><b>正义牺牲</b><span>牺牲祝福冷却缩短 60 秒，每次圣盾后和多数虚空光束都能转好。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1261562}}" alt=""><div><b>复仇之盾</b><span>圣佑额外减伤 10% 并施放复仇之盾，吸收 30% 最大生命值。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:146956}}" alt=""><div><b>圣光决断</b><span>自律中仍可开圣盾，每清除一个有害效果回 10% 血。</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-note">可选替换：<b>治疗之手、惩罚、正义保护、圣光的正义</b> ↔ <b>强化保护祝福、残光、带头冲锋、迅捷审判</b>（换掉治疗之手时圣疗按 7 分钟基础冷却算）。</p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

